M<sub>A</sub> = 10 \u00d7 10<sup>\u20133</sup>\n and M<sub>B</sub> = 5 \u00d7 10<sup>\u20133</sup>"},{"identifier":"B","content":"M<sub>A</sub> = 25 \u00d7 10<sup>\u20133</sup>\n and M<sub>B</sub> = 50 \u00d7 10<sup>\u20133</sup>"},{"identifier":"C","content":"M<sub>A</sub> = 5 \u00d7 10<sup>\u20133</sup>\n and M<sub>B</sub> = 10 \u00d7 10<sup>\u20133</sup>"},{"identifier":"D","content":"M<sub>A</sub> = 50 \u00d7 10<sup>\u20133</sup>\n and M<sub>B</sub> = 25 \u00d7 10<sup>\u20133</sup>"}],"correct_options":["C"],"explanation":"Molar weigh of 'A' = M<sub>A</sub>\n<br><br>Molar weigh of 'B' = M<sub>B</sub>\n<br><br>Molar mass of AB<sub>2</sub> = M<sub>A</sub> + 2M<sub>B</sub>\n<br><br>Molar mass of A<sub>2</sub>B<sub>2</sub> = 2(M<sub>A</sub> + M<sub>B</sub>)\n<br><br>5 mol AB<sub>2</sub> weighs 125 g\n<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> AB<sub>2</sub> = 25 g/mol\n<br><br>10 mol A<sub>2</sub>B<sub>2</sub> weighs 300 g\n<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> A<sub>2</sub>B<sub>2</sub> = 30 g/mol\n<br><br>So, M<sub>A</sub> + 2M<sub>B</sub> = 25 ..............(1)\n<br><br>and 2(M<sub>A</sub> + M<sub>B</sub>) = 30 ..............(2)\n<br><br>By solving (1) and (2),\n<br><br>M<sub>A</sub> = 5 gm = 5 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 10<sup>-3</sup> kg\n<br><br>M<sub>B</sub> = 10 gm = 10 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 10<sup>-3</sup> kg","paperKey":"jee-main-2019-online-12th-april-morning-slot"}]}